---
layout: base.njk
title: Software & Tools
permalink: /software/
description: "Software from the Stroud Lab: LizardLens, LizardMorph, PyTLidar, and lande."
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap-text wrap-text--intro center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Software &amp; tools</p>
    <h1>What we build</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      We are entering a new generation of how we can study ecology and evolution. Our lab
      focuses on two major innovations:
</p>
<p>
(1) automated pipelines that use machine-learning techniques to process data at previously-unprecedented speeds and scales for our field,
</p>
<p>
(2) advanced instrumentation of field biology, specifically using or developing
      sensors for passively collecting data in the wild, either from the environment (e.g.,
      quantifying the structural or thermal environment) or from organisms (e.g., wearable
      sensors....i.e., lizard backpacks!). 
</p>
<p>We developed most of the tools below to facilitate
      our lab's specific research needs, however developed them in a way that they are 
      customizable and/or broadly of use to biologists.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule-wrap rule-wrap--text"><hr></div>
<section class="section--tight">
  <div class="wrap-text">
    {%- for s in software %}
    <div class="tool-entry{% if s.image %} tool-entry--with-img{% endif %}">
      {% if s.image %}
      <img class="tool-entry__img"
           src="/assets/img/software/{{ s.image }}"
           alt="{{ s.imageAlt or s.name }}">
      {% endif %}
      <div class="tool-entry__body">
        <p class="card__kicker">{{ s.kicker }}</p>
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.summary }}</p>
        {% if s.extra %}<p>{{ s.extra | safe }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if s.paper or s.doi or s.repo %}
        <p class="pub__meta">
          {% if s.paper %}For details, see {{ s.paper }}.{% endif %}
          {% if s.doi %} <a href="{{ s.doi }}">Preprint</a>{% endif %}
          {% if s.repo %}{% if s.doi %} ·{% endif %} <a href="{{ s.repo }}">Code</a>{% endif %}
        </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if not loop.last %}<hr>{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule-wrap rule-wrap--text"><hr></div>
<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="wrap-text">
    <h2>Why this matters to the lab</h2>
    <p>
      Georgia Tech is one of the best engineering and computer science
      universities in the world, and we are an evolutionary ecology lab inside it.
      That is not an accident of geography we intend to waste. Wearable sensors,
      lidar, and deep learning give access to data types that eco-evolutionary
      field studies simply have not had before, opening questions that were
      previously unanswerable rather than merely tedious.
    </p>
    <p>
      Much of this work is done with Master's students from the OMSCS programme
      and with undergraduate capstone teams from Electrical and Computer
      Engineering, who have designed and built hardware for us as well as
      software.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
